        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AlienCity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness has swallowed the city, leaving only the sound of distant echoes and the creatures roaming the empty streets. An unknown alien force has unleashed mutated beings that hunt anything that moves. The police fell. The army collapsed. Every defense line failed. Now there is only you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AlienCity delivers a fast-paced, arcade-style FPS experience set in a stylized, eerie urban environment. Fight through narrow streets, abandoned buildings, and shadow-covered alleys while waves of alien creatures close in from every direction. Precision, timing, and awareness are the only tools that keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their numbers grow.<br>Your ammo does not.<br>The city is your final battleground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and Responsive Gunplay</strong><br>Tight, arcade-focused shooting with strong hit feedback and high-impact headshots that reward accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Alien Enemy Types</strong><br>Face small, agile mutants, larger aggressive creatures, and various forms of extraterrestrial threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Dark City Atmosphere</strong><br>A unique visual style combining heavy contrast, chromatic distortion, and minimalistic shapes to create an unsettling environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Variety</strong><br>Use rifle and sniper tailored to different combat ranges and playstyles.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AlienCity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkness has swallowed the city, leaving only the sound of distant echoes and the creatures roaming the empty streets. An unknown alien force has unleashed mutated beings that hunt anything that moves. The police fell. The army collapsed. Every defense line failed. Now there is only you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AlienCity delivers a fast-paced, arcade-style FPS experience set in a stylized, eerie urban environment. Fight through narrow streets, abandoned buildings, and shadow-covered alleys while waves of alien creatures close in from every direction. Precision, timing, and awareness are the only tools that keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their numbers grow.<br>Your ammo does not.<br>The city is your final battleground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and Responsive Gunplay</strong><br>Tight, arcade-focused shooting with strong hit feedback and high-impact headshots that reward accuracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Alien Enemy Types</strong><br>Face small, agile mutants, larger aggressive creatures, and various forms of extraterrestrial threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Dark City Atmosphere</strong><br>A unique visual style combining heavy contrast, chromatic distortion, and minimalistic shapes to create an unsettling environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Variety</strong><br>Use rifle and sniper tailored to different combat ranges and playstyles.</p>",
